      "content": "I'll read both the original test and the CUT source to understand the code before improving it.Now I have a clear picture. The original test has many unused imports, unused constants, and an unused field. I'll clean those up and improve the comments for clarity.The improved test compiled successfully. The refactored file removes all unused imports (16 of them), unused constants (`UTF_16`, `UTF_8`, `LARGE_TEST_STRING`), and the unused `random` field, replaces the Unicode escape sequences in `TEST_STRING` with the actual characters for readability, and replaces terse inline comments with clearer explanations of why `available()` returns 0 before the first read and `length - 1` after it."
